## ─── Multi-Profile Setup ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## Create one .env.<profile> file per Garmin account:
##   .env.MED       → your account
##   .env.Julie     → your wife's account
##
## Each file needs GARMIN_EMAIL and GARMIN_PASSWORD at minimum.
## Data is stored in data/<profile>/ (e.g., data/MED/, data/Julie/).
##
## Usage:
##   npm run manage-workouts -- --profile MED --export
##   npm run export-activities -- --profile Julie
##   npm run start   (interactive menu prompts for profile)
## ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GARMIN_EMAIL=your_email@example.com
GARMIN_PASSWORD="your_password"
# Note: Always quote passwords that contain special characters like # % & etc.
# Otherwise, dotenv will treat them as comments and truncate the password

# ─── LLM auth (need at least one) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Option 1: GitHub PAT with an active Copilot subscription
#   Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens (no special scopes required)
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...

# Option 2: BYOK — OpenAI
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Option 3: BYOK — Anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: override the default Copilot model
# COPILOT_MODEL=gpt-5.2
